Ghost Robot port 8b1f9a0d ("In loop filters bug fixes"), i265.

Only the restoration_pick.c hunk is reachable on this port: the
seq_header.enable_restoration change needs the (absent)
enable_restoration_filtering config knob, the stat_report guards need
stat_report=1 (no knob), and the unit_info_valid guard needs
use_prev_frame_coeffs (wn level 6, unreachable). Ported: in
search_restoration_unit_size_with_stop, GhostRobot's finish walk counts
wiener bits with a plane-based window (WIENER_WIN luma) while the seg
phase keeps the filter_tap_lvl-derived wn_luma.

